From: Raven Contributors <raven@localhost>
Subject: [PATCH] Add an opt-in monocular OpenCL feature tracking path

Keep the default CPU path and filter mathematics unchanged.
OpenCL selection requires a GPU runtime and does not silently select a CPU device.

Upstream-Status: Pending
Signed-off-by: Raven Contributors <raven@localhost>

